p_existing,744,V4005712fb,4e00571345,;"Záloha již existuje. Bude přepsána";backup_existing,745,V40057137e,6b005713e5,;"Sicherung bestehender Daten. Alte Sicherung wird überschrieben.";backup_existing,746,V40057144b,61005714a8,;"Το αντίγραφο ασφαλείας υπάρχει ήδη. Θα αντικατασταθεί";backup_existing,747,V40057123e,5700571291,;"Backup already exist. It'll be overwritten";backup_existing,748,V4005913af,7b00591426,;"Se ha detectado una copia de seguridad\, la copia de seguridad será sobreescrita";backup_existing,749,V400571337,5b0057138e,;"Yá hai una copia de seguranza. Va sobrescribise";backup_existing,750,V4005a142e,57005a1481,;"Babeskopia badago aurretik. Gainidatziko da";backup_existing,751,V4005a13e1,65005a1442,;"درحال حاضر نسخه پشتیبان موجود است. روی آن بازنویسی می‌شود";backup_existing,752,V4005a13e0,55005a1431,;"Varmuuskopio on jo olemassa. Se korvataan";backup_existing,753,V4005713ae,55005713ff,;"Sauvegarde existante\, elle sera remplacée";backup_existing,754,V400571347,63005713a6,;"Xa hai unha copia de seguranza\; a nova sobreescribirase";backup_existing,755,V4005712a6,4c005712ee,;"बेकअप मौजूद हे\, ये उसे मिटा देगा";backup_existing,756,V4005712f8,6000571354,;"Sigurnosna kopija već postoji te će biti prebrisana.";backup_existing,757,V40057137f,5e005713d9,;"A biztonsági másolat már létezik. Felül fogja írni";backup_existing,758,V400571312,5400571362,;"Cadangan sudah ada. Hal itu akan ditimpa";backup_existing,759,V4005a13e6,4f005a1431,;"Backup esistente\, sarà sovrascritto";backup_existing,760,V40054110c,460054114e,;"ישנו גיבוי קיים. הוא יוחלף";backup_existing,761,V4005a1196,42005a11d4,;"バックアップは既に存在します。上書きされます";backup_existing,763,V4004e10b6,53004e1105,;"ມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຮອງໄວ້ແລ້ວ\, ມັນຈະຖືກແທນທີ່";backup_existing,764,V40057136a,5b005713c1,;"Dublējumkopija jau eksistē. Tā tiks pārrakstīta";backup_existing,765,V4005b1473,1a005c14ce,;"အရံသိမ်းဆည်းမှုရှိနှင့်ပြီးသားပါ။ ထပ်ရေးလိုက်ပါမည်။";backup_existing,766,V4005712ad,5c00571305,;"Sikkhetskopi finnes alt\, den vil bli overskrevet";backup_existing,767,V400571313,5900571368,;"Backup bestaande\, het zal overschreven worden";backup_existing,768,V4005712f0,5a00571346,;"Kopia zapasowa już istnieje. Będzie zastąpiona";backup_existing,769,V4005a13b6,50005a1402,;"Backup já existe\, será sobrescrevido";backup_existing,770,V40057133b,5d00571394,;"Cópia de segurança existente\, irá ser substituída";backup_existing,771,V4005a1470,5b005a14c7,;"Copia de rezervă există deja. Va fi suprascrisă";backup_existing,772,V4005a13c0,5f005a141b,;"Резервная копия уже существует и будет перезаписана";backup_existing,773,V400571332,5600571384,;"Záloha už existuje\, a preto bude prepísaná";backup_existing,774,V4005a13a9,6d005a1412,;"Naredite varnostno kopijo obstoječih podatkov\, ker bodo izbrisani";backup_existing,775,V400571299,4d005712e2,;"Фајл већ постоји и биће пребрисан";backup_existing,776,V4005712ec,4d00571335,;"Backup finns\, kommer skrivas över";backup_existing,777,V40057127a,4c005712c2,;"Mevcut yedeğin üzerine yazılacak";backup_existing,778,V400571318,5c00571370,;"Резервна копія вже існує\, вона буде перезаписана";backup_existing,779,V400570fe3,3900571018,;"备份已存在，该备份将被覆盖";backup_existing,780,V400570ff0,3a00571026,;"備份已存在，該備份將被覆蓋。";settings_simple_calendar_summary,741,V401254926,95012549b7,;"Use the (simpler) Android interface for date/time selection\, instead of Google interface";settings_simple_calendar_summary,742,V4011a4643,7f011a46be,;"استعمال اليومية البسيطة واداة إختيار التاريخ بدل تلك التابعة لغوغل";settings_simple_calendar_summary,743,V4012050e1,b10120518e,;"Usa la interfície (més simple) de l'Android per a la selecció de data i hora\, en comptes de la interfície de Google";settings_simple_calendar_summary,744,V4011647f2,8801164876,;"Používat jednodušší rozhraní pro výběr data a času\, namísto rozhraní Google";settings_simple_calendar_summary,745,V4011a4d85,79011a4dfa,;"Einfachen Kalender und Zeitauswahl für Erinnerungen benutzen";settings_simple_calendar_summary,746,V4011a4f60,94011a4ff0,;"Χ